/**
 * @defgroup stream_cr_api stream CR API
 * @ingroup stream_api
 *
 * @brief Composition Root API for the `stream` port.
 *
 * @details
 * This API exposes the CR-facing services used to configure and create
 * `stream` factories, register adapters, and create or destroy specialized
 * stream creator objects.
 *
 * Main headers:
 * - `stream_cr_api.h`
 * - `stream_creators_cr_api.h`
 * - `creators/stream_buffer_creator_cr_api.h`
 * - `creators/stream_file_creator_cr_api.h`
 * - `creators/stream_io_creator_cr_api.h`
 *
 * @note Runtime modules should not include this API directly.
 */
